  "description": "ImageSharp 2.1 imaging and font backend for PdfPinata.\n\nProvides ImageSharpImageSource, ImageSharpFontResolver and ImageSharpGlyphOutlineProvider, built against SixLabors.ImageSharp 2.1.x and SixLabors.Fonts 1.0.1, the last releases under the Apache-2.0 licence. ImageSharp 2.1.x is end of life and has five security advisories that will never be fixed.\n\nUse PdfPinata.ImageSharp4 instead, unless you target Unity (netstandard2.1) or must keep your dependencies under Apache-2.0. Both packages have the same types in the same namespaces, so switching between them is a change to the project file only.",
